  "title": "BER: Move extra unknown SEQUENCE/SET field to PI_UNDECODED",
  "description": "PI_MALFORMED is too strong a category, since extra unknown fields are\nsimply skipped and the rest of the ASN.1 processed, unless the\npreference to decode unexpected fields is on, in which case it isn't\neven skipped.\n\nThis matches other similar expert infos, both here and in PER.",
